<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ridley Corp year net profit flat.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ridley Corp year net profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    36.27 vs 31.73</p>
<p>    Net				     22.36 vs 21.43</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     3.75 vs 3.75</p>
<p>NOTE: Ridley Corporation Ltd is a stock feed and rural merchandise supplier. It is currently mounting a takeover bid for malster Joe White Maltings Ltd.</p>
</text>
